/target
/fuzz/target
/fuzz/corpus
/fuzz/artifacts
/examples/external-codec/target

# Playwright dev-time dependency tree for the web console UI suite (design §15.37):
# installed by `npm ci`, never shipped, never vendored into the binary.
/web/ui-tests/node_modules
/web/ui-tests/test-results
/web/ui-tests/playwright-report

# Claude Code. `/.claude/settings.json` IS tracked — it is shared project
# configuration (the permission allowlist, the enabled plugins). What is excluded
# is machine-local: a runtime lock, and the personal-override file whose whole
# purpose is to not be shared.
/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
/.claude/settings.local.json
__pycache__/

# The capability-blessed copy of `serial-nexus-devprep` (design §15.45). Installed by
# `serial-nexus-devprep install`, restricted to mode 0700, and blessed with
# `cap_dac_override+ep` by one `sudo setcap`. Never committed: a capability-carrying
# binary is machine state, the kernel strips the blessing on any rewrite anyway, and
# each checkout must own its own copy rather than share one.
/.snx-bin
